#, object-pascal-format
msgid ""
"The graphic control \"%s\" was placed directly on the form.\n"
"Windowless (graphic) controls paint onto the form itself and will be HIDDEN behind the \n"
"content area. Move it into the Surface content container so it stays visible."
msgstr ""
"图形控件 \"%s\" 被直接放在了窗体上。\n"
"无窗口的图形控件绘制在窗体自身上,会被内容区遮挡而看不见。\n"
"请把它移进 Surface 内容容器,它才会显示。"

#: tycontrols.strconsts.rstysurfacepurpose
